Dingo is a multiplayer virtual reality game focused on free movement and physical interaction. Instead of using traditional joysticks to move, you use your hands and arms to push yourself forward, climb, jump, and move around naturally.

Master the movement system, improve your skills, and discover new ways to move through the virtual world. Every movement depends on how you use your arms, hands, and body, making practice and timing important parts of the experience.

Play with other players in VR, meet friends, and enjoy a movement-based experience where you control how you move. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced VR player, Dingo gives you the freedom to develop your own playstyle and get better over time.

Put on your headset, use your hands to move, and experience VR movement in a whole new way.

Move your way. Play your way. Welcome to Dingo!
